    a text called 'the name' is 'gen buffer reference' of 'the stem'.
    a text called 'the size access' is 'gen buffer property' of 'the stem' and "size".
    a text called 'the counter' is 'gen buffer companion' of "appends made".
    a text called 'the overflow flag' is 'gen buffer companion' of "overflowed".
    a text called 'the stale flag' is 'gen buffer companion' of "found an error already pending".
    a number called 'the piece draw' is 'rng below' of 48.
    a number called 'the piece length' is 'the piece draw' add 16.
    a text called 'the piece' is 'gen buffer filler' of 'the piece length'.
    (Enough appends to clear the reserve, plus a drawn surplus, so the
     total is never the same number twice and never merely brushes 4096.)
    a number called 'the minimum appends' is 4200 divide 'the piece length'.
    a number called 'the extra appends' is 'rng below' of 150.
    a number called 'the append count' is 'the minimum appends' add 'the extra appends' add 2.
    a number called 'the total bytes' is 'the append count' multiply 'the piece length'.
    a text called 'the declaration' is 'gen dynamic buffer declaration' of 'the name'.
    a text called 'the counter declaration' is "a number called {'the counter'} is 0".
