    a text called 'the size check' is 'gen assert number is' of "BUF-03" and 'the size access' and 'the total bytes'.
    a text called 'the flag check' is 'gen assert false' of "BUF-03" and 'the overflow flag'.
    a text called 'the closing read' is "Print {'the size access'}".
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the declaration', 'the counter declaration', 'the flag declaration', 'the stale declaration', 'the stale handler', 'the loop line', 'the size check', 'the flag check', 'the closing read'].
