 below). BUF-54 ("a list also accepts Free") is a 0.4.15-only claim
 (vox #109) - not this batch's, per the evening brief's rule that a row
 whose claim is new in the stack is not built until after the release;
 skipped, said here rather than silently. BUF-50 (the worked example,
 reproduced verbatim) and BUF-53 (the per-iteration idiom, half not
 assertable) are lower-priority composites whose sub-claims this batch
